# commit, sprint-7.md's §7 appendix, touching nothing under
# frontend/ or backend/): frontend=success, backend=success — ruled
# out as the cause, confirmed two ways: (1) the job-level result
# itself (the 7 frontend structural checks run inside that job's own
# `npm run build` and it passed), (2) a direct local re-run of all 7
# checks against a worktree pinned to this exact commit (6/7 passed
